{
  "file_id": "ID03521",
  "text_count": 178,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Is everyone okay?",
      "_offset": 3455,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "We managed to survive that,\nsomehow...",
      "_offset": 3481,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Seems like the river by the cliff\ncarried us away.",
      "_offset": 3520,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "What's with all the fish? They all\ngot together and made a raft...",
      "_offset": 3571,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "That was my Marching Fishes! I can\nsummon fish at will!",
      "_offset": 3638,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "I see. Thanks...uh, Pukamon?",
      "_offset": 3694,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "I'm Gomamon now!",
      "_offset": 3723,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "What? And I just got used to your\nother name...",
      "_offset": 3740,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "We've evolved!",
      "_offset": 3788,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "\"Evolved\"...? Whaddya mean,\n\"evolved\"?",
      "_offset": 3803,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Normally, it's when organisms\nchange into more advanced species,\nbut...",
      "_offset": 3842,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "That's it, that's \"evolution\"!",
      "_offset": 3914,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Well, at least you look stronger\nnow!",
      "_offset": 3945,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "So...you've evolved, but are you\nstill \"Digital Monsters\"?",
      "_offset": 3983,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Yup, and it's a good thing we've\nmet, Taichi! I can't evolve on my\nown!",
      "_offset": 4042,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I don't really get it...",
      "_offset": 4114,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "We don't really get it, either.",
      "_offset": 4139,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "It's okay, you're stronger now, so\nthat's enough for us!",
      "_offset": 4171,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "So, moving on. What should we do\nnow?",
      "_offset": 4228,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "We ought to go back up and wait\nfor help!",
      "_offset": 4266,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Easier said than done. We were\nwashed away pretty far, and it'll\nbe hard to get back up that cliff.",
      "_offset": 4308,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "What if we see another monster \nlike that giant beetle, but shiny, \nblack and with tons of legs?",
      "_offset": 4408,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Anyway, we have to go *somewhere*!\nIf we just stand around, nothing's\ngonna get done.",
      "_offset": 4505,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I don't wanna see any more bugs or\nsnakes or anything like that!",
      "_offset": 4591,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "But where do we go?",
      "_offset": 4656,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "I saw the ocean earlier, so let's\ngo check it out!",
      "_offset": 4676,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "At times like this, we should be\nstaying here and waiting\nfor...hey, wait!",
      "_offset": 4727,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Whew... I'm tired...",
      "_offset": 4802,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Are you okay? Let's take a break!",
      "_offset": 4823,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I evolved from Tsunomon to\nGabumon...",
      "_offset": 4857,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "You evolved and got bigger, just\nlike that! Hey, Taichi, why don't\nyou try evolving too?",
      "_offset": 4895,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "If I evolve and start breathing\nfire, you'll be the first to see!",
      "_offset": 4984,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Thanks to Sora, I was able to\nevolve to Piyomon!",
      "_offset": 5050,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Hey, Taichi...What do they mean\nwhen they say it's thanks to us?",
      "_offset": 5099,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Wasn't there a story like that?\n\"One day, a bird that Sora saved \ncame back to return the favor.\"",
      "_offset": 5164,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Oh, Taichi, stop joking around...",
      "_offset": 5262,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Hey, Gomamon... is your mouth\nfull of gums or something?",
      "_offset": 5296,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Huh? That's silly!",
      "_offset": 5353,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "He's probably like a gumball,\nsince he's round and rolls around.",
      "_offset": 5372,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "You're *both* wrong!",
      "_offset": 5437,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Hey, Mimi, do you think I look\nweird?",
      "_offset": 5458,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "I dunno, I can't tell if I like\nyou more as Palmon or Tanemon...",
      "_offset": 5496,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "You know, Palmon, that flower on\nyour head looks kinda like Mimi's\nhat.",
      "_offset": 5561,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Really? That means Mimi and I\nmatch! Yay!",
      "_offset": 5633,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "You seem to be doing okay, Mimi.",
      "_offset": 5675,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Yeah...Kuwagamon's scary, but I'm\nglad everyone else is here.",
      "_offset": 5708,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Oh yeah, it's always reassuring to\nhave your friends around!",
      "_offset": 5770,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Normally, evolution is something\nthat's supposed to take place over\ntime...",
      "_offset": 5831,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Er, you're talking about kinda\ndifficult stuff. Can you put that\nin easier words?",
      "_offset": 5907,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "By the way, Tentomon, why do you\ntalk in Kansai dialect?",
      "_offset": 5989,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "...Er, could'ja also put that in\neasier words...?",
      "_offset": 6046,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Nice dodge of the question\nthere...",
      "_offset": 6096,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Now that Patamon's evolved, he can\nfly!",
      "_offset": 6132,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Look, look, Takeru! I'm flying!",
      "_offset": 6172,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "You really are flying!",
      "_offset": 6204,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Kinda shaky there...",
      "_offset": 6227,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "I know, right? Look at him go!",
      "_offset": 6248,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "I can fly faster when I put some\nreal effort into it, you know!",
      "_offset": 6279,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "You can do it, Patamon!",
      "_offset": 6343,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Okay! Let's go!",
      "_offset": 6367,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Taichi, are we leaving already?",
      "_offset": 6383,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Yeah, let's go!",
      "_offset": 6415,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "No, I haven't talked to everyone.",
      "_offset": 6431,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Mmm! I can smell the ocean!",
      "_offset": 6465,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "I can see it! The ocean!",
      "_offset": 6493,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "...Hm?",
      "_offset": 6518,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Why are there phones ringing?\nHere, of all places?",
      "_offset": 6525,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "How are there public telephones in\nsuch a place? It's illogical!",
      "_offset": 6576,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "They look like pretty normal phone\nboxes, though.",
      "_offset": 6641,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Hey, Koushirou, gimme 10 yen. I'll\ntry calling home.",
      "_offset": 6691,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Oh, then I'll give you my\ntelephone card!",
      "_offset": 6744,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "I'll try calling Mama, too!",
      "_offset": 6786,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "_offset": 6814,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Did I call the wrong number...? It\nstarted giving me the weather\nforecast...",
      "_offset": 6822,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Mimi said they've suddenly gone\ncrazy!",
      "_offset": 6899,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "I couldn't reach Takeru's place...\nshould I try mine?",
      "_offset": 6938,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "So this machine can talk to people\nfrom far away?",
      "_offset": 6992,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "What's with this phone message?\nThe phone lines must have been\ncrossed strangely...",
      "_offset": 7042,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Maybe it'll work if you hit it?",
      "_offset": 7126,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "They look like your normal\neveryday phone boxes...",
      "_offset": 7158,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "That means we're in Japan,\nright?\n...no, we can't be.",
      "_offset": 7209,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Hey, Jou! What's \"Japan\"?",
      "_offset": 7263,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Yamato is trying to call my place,\nbut we're not getting anywhere...",
      "_offset": 7289,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Don't look so down, Takeru...",
      "_offset": 7358,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "It's not working at all...\nwe can't get through.",
      "_offset": 7388,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Even if we could connect, she's\nprobably out with the flower\narrangement class, not home...",
      "_offset": 7437,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "What the heck's going on here...",
      "_offset": 7529,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Also, I'm getting hungry...",
      "_offset": 7562,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Yeah, we haven't had lunch...\nokay, let's take a break!",
      "_offset": 7590,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Does anyone have anything to eat?\nHuh? Didn't this fall from the\nsky?",
      "_offset": 7646,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Huh? Didn't this fall from the\nsky?",
      "_offset": 7716,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Looks like we've all got one.",
      "_offset": 7752,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "What are these, anyway...?",
      "_offset": 7782,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "In any case, we were talking about\nfood, weren't we?",
      "_offset": 7809,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "I have a laptop, a digital camera,\nand a cell phone, but...",
      "_offset": 7862,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "None of them have worked since we\ncame here.",
      "_offset": 7922,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "All I have is this, my pocket\ntelescope!",
      "_offset": 7967,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "I've got this! Look, candy!",
      "_offset": 8008,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Looks tasty! You're not from our\nschool, are you?",
      "_offset": 8036,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Yeah! It's summer vacation, so I\ncame to visit Yamato! Right?",
      "_offset": 8086,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Those two seem awfully close...",
      "_offset": 8148,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Maybe they're cousins?",
      "_offset": 8180,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "What did you bring, Mimi?",
      "_offset": 8203,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Solid fuel, a fishing set...",
      "_offset": 8229,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "You've got some pretty\nfull-fledged survival gear. That\ncould come in handy...",
      "_offset": 8258,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Looks like these phones really\ndon't work at all. Huh? There's \na sound in the distance...",
      "_offset": 8337,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "HRAAAAH!",
      "_offset": 8428,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "It's coming for us!",
      "_offset": 8437,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Sheeeeeeeell!",
      "_offset": 8457,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Aaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 8471,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "W-what's that?!",
      "_offset": 8482,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
